  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you roll Initiative, you can give yourself a bonus to the roll equal to your Charisma modifier.</p><p>You also gain another way to use your Sneak Attack: you don't need Advantage on the attack roll to use it against a creature if you are within 5 feet of it, no other creature is within 5 feet of you, and you don't have Disadvantage on the attack roll. All the other rules for Sneak Attack still apply to you.</p>",
